\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Single-factor evaluation of the Maxwell--Kronecker projection over the full campaign range. Panels as in Fig.~6 of the main paper. In~(c) the retained energy fraction reaches the white-noise floor $r/I=1/16$ and the compressed spectral gap $\sigma _{K+1}/\sigma _K$ approaches unity at $-20$~dB, which is the diagnostic form of delay-pole collapse.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:s_compression}{{3}{3}{}{}{}}
